{"id":"partes","lemma":"partes","pos":"noun","rank":636,"glosses":["genitalia"],"ipa":"/ˈpaɾtes/","gender":"f","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-partes.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los policías están por todas partes.","en":"Cops are everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448272","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"Civility","l":"policía"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null]},{"text":"El inglés se habla en muchas partes del mundo.","en":"English is spoken in many parts of the world.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730233","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"English"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"world, earth"}]},{"text":"No veo nada porque en todas partes está oscuro.","en":"I can't see anything because the whole place is dark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590201","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"because"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dark"}]},{"text":"Va a todas partes.","en":"He gets around a lot.","words":[{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null]},{"text":"Esta historia tiene dos partes.","en":"This story is in two parts.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"history"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null]}]}